[{"htmlContent":"<label class=\"BroadTitle\">PoE1 3.29 Allflame Update is LIVE!</label>\n\n<div class=\"CustomizeGroupBox\">\n<ul>\n\n<li>To update your filter, just load it. This will automatically merge your customization into the new filter version. <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=RA27aUdWQb8\">Details</a></li>\n\n<li>Check out the <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"/FAQ\">FAQ</a> if you have troubles.</li>\n\n</ul>\n</div>","fromDate":1784761260000,"toDate":1785726300000},{"htmlContent":"<label class=\"BroadTitle\">3.29 Update in progress...</label>\n\n<div class=\"CustomizeGroupBox\">\n<ul>\n\n<li>We are currently working on the filter update for the 3.29 Allflame league.</li>\n\n<li>It will be ready on Friday, a few hours before the league starts.</li>\n\n<li>You can start customizing your filter now and, once the update is live, just load your filter to update it to the new version! More details <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=RA27aUdWQb8\">here</a>.</li>\n\n<li>There will be a live-stream of the final update step on NeverSinks <a href=\"https://www.twitch.tv/neversink\" target=\"_blank\">Twitch</a> on Friday.</li>\n\n<li> Check out the <a href=\"https://twitter.com/NeverSinkDev\" target=\"_blank\">Twitter</a>, as well as our <a href=\"https://www.discord.gg/mye6xhF\" target=\"_blank\">Discord</a> for news and update notifications!</li>\n\n</ul>\n</div>","fromDate":1721399160000,"toDate":1753453560000}]